  "claim": "The Bends, an album produced by John Leckie and engineered by Nigel Godrich, features artwork by the same person who did the artwork for another of the band's albums, Johnny Greenwood is the Controller.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller. Sentence: Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller is a compilation album created by Jonny Greenwood of Radiohead and released on Trojan Records.\nPage: Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller. Sentence: The album features artwork by Stanley Donwood, who has provided art for every Radiohead album since \"The Bends\" (1995).\nPage: The Bends. Sentence: The Bends (stylised as the bends) is the second studio album by the English alternative rock band Radiohead, released on 13 March 1995 by Parlophone Records in the United Kingdom and by Capitol Records in the United States.\nPage: The Bends. Sentence: The album was produced by John Leckie and engineered by Nigel Godrich, who would go on to co-produce all future albums by the band.",
