        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jonny Greenwood, Stanley Donwood, John Leckie, Nigel Godrich\n- Bands: Radiohead\n- Albums: Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller, The Bends\n- Record Labels: Trojan Records, Parlophone Records, Capitol Records\n\nFacts:\n- The Bends is the second studio album by Radiohead.\n- The Bends was released on 13 March 1995 by Parlophone Records in the United Kingdom and by Capitol Records in the United States.\n- The Bends was produced by John Leckie and engineered by Nigel Godrich.\n- Nigel Godrich later co-produced all future Radiohead albums.\n- Stanley Donwood has provided artwork for every Radiohead album since The Bends.\n- Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller is a compilation album created by Jonny Greenwood of Radiohead and released on Trojan Records.\n- Jonny Greenwood Is the Controller features artwork by Stanley Donwood.",
